      "s1_title": "1. Chrono24 Dealer Application",
      "s1_desc": "You need a professional dealer account on Chrono24. Apply if you don't have one yet.",
      "s2_title": "2. Request API Access",
      "s2_desc": "Contact Chrono24 customer support to request API access. You will be provided with an API key and secret.",
